	quest.0135DF76611A4A25.quest_subtitle: "Smart Chutes behave similarly to Brass Funnels. They can be filtered to only allow certain items through, and be stopped with a redstone signal. Unlike funnels, they can insert and extract at the same time, but can only function vertically."
