	quest.05BC7CBC05B15830.quest_subtitle: "Pushes heat to a small area, careful to not pump too much heat.."
	quest.05BFBACBB2337231.quest_subtitle: "Okay so, andesite is a very abundant stone that you can find in large pockets underground, and they blend really well with the stone texture so keep your eyes open for some. You'll need a lot of this stone if you are going to make any machinery around here so dig as much as you can! Mental note as well, Zinc ores are important too as using it with andesite makes the important alloy used to making machinery."
	quest.05BFBACBB2337231.title: "Andesite, the Foundation"
	quest.05D04965151FFD7E.quest_subtitle: "Transfer energy to and from contraptions."
	quest.05E7258844F3F600.quest_subtitle: "Gives Regeneration"
	quest.062F228BCAE231E6.quest_subtitle: "When a Package Filter is used in a Filter slot, a create component such as a Brass Tunnel or Smart Chute will sort Cardboard Packages depending on if they match the address in the filter."
	quest.063D47D4F61457BC.quest_subtitle: "Lets you schedule trains so that mobs or blaze burnders can drive them."
	quest.065BDCEBC8F29507.quest_desc: ["The &bScythe&r is a &6weapon&r used to &arevive dead villagers from headstones&r. To revive a villager, &akill another villager using the Scythe and then right click on the villager's tombstone&r. When you revive the villager, it will be &erevived as a zombie villager&r."]
	quest.065BDCEBC8F29507.quest_subtitle: "Obtained by killing the Grim Reaper."
	quest.06653E21053ACDF6.quest_subtitle: "A redstone component that toggles on when recieving a redstone signal on one side and off when recieviing a signal on anoter side."
	quest.068BF02B99DABEBD.title: "&aCraft: &fMechanical Eye"
	quest.06BC3C3C934CD81B.quest_desc: ["Using mods like &eNumatics, &eCustom Villager Trades, &eMCA Reborn, and &eXero's Claimable Chunks,&r we created a fully integrated &6economy system. With &bCTV Villager Trades,&r we overhauled the vanilla villager trading system, adding tons of custom trades. &eCreate Numatics establishes a stable currency system that works seamlessly in multiplayer worlds, allowing players to set up shops, banks, and other essential economic features. In multiplayer, instead of starting with a fixed number of claimable chunks, players must exchange coins to claim more chunks. Currency can also help you acquire resources that your island may lack and support your automation and adventure endeavors."]
	quest.06BC3C3C934CD81B.title: "&l&6Economy"
	quest.0709E8AE808EE9DF.quest_subtitle: "Summons Karkinos"
	quest.0729E0E98B1F4B93.title: "&eVisit: &aOverworld"
	quest.074AE1E3FB1810AC.quest_subtitle: "The Hand Crank generates a small amount of Rotational Force through player interaction."
	quest.075B1EEC5E4081F8.quest_subtitle: "Instigate a tethering of souls, trading placeswith and freezing your target while gaininghaste and resistances.Upon reaching your destination, ignite nearbyenemies and pull them closer to you."
	quest.07680D1563629D55.quest_subtitle: "It's really just a belt that doesn't move."
	quest.076C02684CB6D760.quest_subtitle: "Press &c\"Z\"&r To see How to Build It"
