	quest.0C26540D251A4576.quest_desc: [
		"a machine similar to the Mechanical Mixer or Mechanical Press from Create. It automatically registers all cutting recipes from Farmer's Delight. In that sense, it is an automatic Cutting Board."
		""
		"In order to use it, the correct tool has to be placed into the machine, using Right-Click. By default, only knives and axes are allowed."
	]
