	quest.0C8D19B106618A91.quest_subtitle: "The Gearbox is sort of like an extension cord, but for shafts where it can change the direction of the shafts and can have more than one shaft attached in a different side of the gearbox. A vertical gearbox also exists."
	quest.0CB471D75F5441F5.quest_desc: [
		"First, you have to wear backpack (Hose can only be used with backpack equipped), then you have to attach the hose to the tank, by pressing right mouse button. Tank is selected if its border is white, this also means that hose is active. Hose attachment resets everytime when you take off your backpack or remove hose from inventory, so make sure that any of the tanks is selected. There are 3 hose modes, which I'll describe below:"
		""
		"&lSuck Mode&r"
		"You can pick up the fluid from the world or - if clicked on suitable tank - transfer fluid from clicked tank to your backpack's tank."
		""
		"&lSpill Mode&r"
		"You can spill the fluid into the world or - if clicked on suitable tank - transfer fluid from your backpack's tank to clicked tank."
		""
		"&lDrink Mode&r"
		"Allows the player to drink the contents of some tanks - not all fluids are drinkable, some of them may give special effects."
		""
		"&lAdditional Tips:&r"
		"Swap tank attached to hose"
		"If you wear a backpack and hold hose, click N to swap tank which hose is attached to. (Configurable in controls)"
		""
		"&lChange hose mode:&r"
		"If you hold hose, hold Z (Configurable in controls) and scroll up or down (can be set to use keybind only in config) to change active hose mode."
	]
	quest.0CB471D75F5441F5.quest_subtitle: "a useful gadget for managing fluids in your backpack"
	quest.0D07F646B779E78C.quest_desc: ["[Space] to take off [shift] to slow down and hold [r] to bail out"]
	quest.0D07F646B779E78C.quest_subtitle: "Pretty much just and upgraded biplane that can sit 2 people"
	quest.0D1289DF86B1D1D2.quest_subtitle: "A Blaze Burner is a heating component that is required for certain Mixing recipes. It can be used for heating Steam Engines, Bulk Smoking, Bulk Smelting, and as a decorative light source."
	quest.0D595252CB72400E.quest_subtitle: "Upgrading is done at a Smithing Table: Leather + Backpack + Tier Upgrade Item"
	quest.0D6215F673C9E1EF.quest_subtitle: "Adds 3 extra output slots for more loot"
	quest.0D7069552EB099D4.quest_subtitle: "Choose your enchantments."
	quest.0D8549B6B02B0868.quest_subtitle: "When pumped with oxygen, fills inserted equipment with oxygen"
	quest.0D9C8CE4F91C36BD.quest_subtitle: "Adds a furnace to the backpack."
	quest.0DAD9AEBC7539334.quest_subtitle: "The Andesite Funnel is used to extract or insert materials into inventories, similar in nature to the Brass Funnel."
	quest.0DB0801CB423315D.quest_subtitle: "The Steam Engine is a block that provides Rotational Force. It outputs the highest Stress Unit (SU) capacity of all the survival-mode power-generating blocks. It converts the pressure caused by heating Water in a Fluid Tank into Rotational Force, allowing for large scale item production and multiple contraptions."
	quest.0DBD543699302F64.quest_subtitle: "Very difficult"
