	quest.111B98CC64D59F49.quest_desc: [
		"Fluids can be added through the upgrade tab slots or by holding a fluid container at the cursor and clicking on the desired tank."
		""
		"Potions can be stored in the tank, preserving their effects and allowing them to be used with a hose in drink mode."
		""
		"Splash and lingering potions can also be stored and used with the hose in spill mode to throw them into the world."
	]
	quest.111B98CC64D59F49.quest_subtitle: "Enhances the backpack with two fluid tanks."
	quest.111BB023102A2221.quest_subtitle: "Increases treasure chance"
	quest.111C3069CE77EFF2.quest_subtitle: "Attribute filters focus only on data. The filter can Allow items with any of the desired attributes, only allow them if they have all of the desired attributes, or deny items with any of the selected attributes. A reference item is required to show and choose attributes, but attributes can be added by multiple items."
