	quest.1353044D11EEAEAC.title: "Ponder Stone Generations"
	quest.13963A510D529BD4.quest_desc: ["There are hundreds of custom-added recipes and over 40 custom items to enhance the &6automation process.&r By integrating mods like &eCreate,&r &eAE2,&r and numerous &eCreate add-ons&r along with many custom items, we've created a rewarding and progressive &6automation tree&r with a difficulty on par with &6Satisfactory.&r The goal was to blend all the mods seamlessly, encouraging players to automate a wide range of materials to complete the automation tree. This system, offers an extremely challenging yet rewarding experience."]
	quest.13963A510D529BD4.title: "&l&bAutomation"
	quest.139DAA6E8CF4267A.quest_desc: [
		"At the bottom of the inventory, you may have noticed a search bar."
		""
		"This is the &dJust Enough Items&r, or &dJEI&r, search bar. "
		""
		"If you type \"Wood\", for example, the &dJEI &ritem list at the right of the screen will show all items with \"Wood\" in the name."
		""
		"Adding a @ at the start of the search query will show the items from a specific mod, for example @Adorn"
		""
		"To favorite an item, press &bA &rwhile hovering over it in the &dJEI &ritem list."
	]
