	quest.1AD10B82011B37E4.quest_desc: ["Elytras run out of durability twice as fast and repair themselves when you take damage (proportional to the damage taken), balancing out the durability change. This incentivizes using explosive rockets! Additionally, Elytras reduce magic damage to 0.85 when worn and fly slower when not boosting, encouraging the use of higher flight duration rockets. While wearing an Elytra, you are more \"End-like\" and take damage in water or rain."]
