	quest.1E2C2EFDB9584889.quest_desc: [
		"Obsidian pillars, End gateways, the spawn platform, and the portal itself in the middle of the island have all been redesigned. Additionally, the dragon no longer spawns from the start - instead, it will be summoned once a player gets close to the bell tower in the center."
		""
		"To resummon the dragon, the 4 crystals no longer go right next to the portal. Instead, you'll see 4 bedrock blocks on the floor inside the tower, one in each directional wing of the building. The crystals can be placed on these 4 blocks to start summoning the dragon again. That being said, we do actually still support vanilla crystal summoning positions, to avoid confusing players who aren't familiar with the mod."
	]
	quest.1E2C2EFDB9584889.quest_subtitle: "An overhaul of the main End Island where the dragon fight takes place!"
	quest.1E4200A0817D30D3.quest_subtitle: "The Cogwheel is a basic mechanical component in Create that relays rotation."
	quest.1E44D5BFF5B1BC7A.quest_desc: ["Different stone generations can be extremely useful when automating certain ores."]
	quest.1E452DB4DCAD2939.title: "Obtain Crude Oil"
	quest.1E5A2F5A0E941063.quest_subtitle: "Easy"
	quest.1E9307F6621D7781.quest_subtitle: "Farm designed for plains animals, perfect for livestock mobs"
	quest.1EBED2D32637D735.quest_subtitle: "Extreamly difficult"
	quest.1ECF4A353E90FD47.quest_desc: ["The &6Bouquet&r is a &6craftable item&r that is used to &6start a relationship with a Villager&r. While a player can &bgift&r it to a &bVillager&r at any time, the player needs at least &c10 hearts&r with the Villager for them to &aagree&r to start a &5relationship&r with them."]
	quest.1ECF4A353E90FD47.quest_subtitle: "Nice gift to start a relationship"
	quest.1EE8A9FD1DCEDEA5.quest_desc: [
		"Accepts only music disks in the slot."
		"Music is available only for player who wears the backpack, other players do not hear the music."
	]
	quest.1EE8A9FD1DCEDEA5.quest_subtitle: "Allows listening to music."
	quest.1F1E327828376540.quest_desc: ["The &6Baby&r is an &6item&r that can be &6obtained through&r &dmarriage&r, not to be confused with the baby life stage of a Villager. A player may alternatively &6purchase&r a &aSirben baby&r from &4cultists&r, though it will not be considered player's child unless the player adopts them."]
	quest.1F3C1EB02C8050CF.quest_desc: ["Endershards can be obtained by completing various quests throughout all the questlines. You can also purchase them from the cultist NPC."]
	quest.1F3C1EB02C8050CF.title: "&eObtain: &f8x Ender Shards"
	quest.1F472F1AD3803654.quest_desc: ["Different stone generations can be extremely useful when automating certain ores."]
