	quest.287F4B9405EBCBDE.quest_subtitle: "Crates can be obtained through fishing loot pools. Note: You can also automate fishing with a net from the Create Integrated Farming mod."
	quest.2886208CFA0919AA.quest_subtitle: "Creates air currents like a standard nozzle to catch airborne creatures like phantoms"
	quest.28913217FB7B4073.quest_desc: ["When consumed, it will remove a single random negative effect from the player, keeping positive ones untouched. This provides a simple use for Cocoa Beans in difficult, risky trips."]
	quest.28913217FB7B4073.quest_subtitle: "Hot Cocoa is made by brewing a milk bottle with two Cocoa Beans and a piece of Sugar."
	quest.289E7BA6F1DC1F33.quest_desc: [
		"The hydration depletion speed is biome-dependent, meaning you will get thirsty more easily in hot or dry biomes, and less so in cold or wet ones. Hydration is more relevant than temperature, so building your base in wet biomes is more advisable than doing so in cold ones."
		"This system is also compatible with Cold Sweat, and will use their more precise temperature calculations if the mod is present in the pack."
		""
		"The stack size for water bottles has been increased to 64, to make them fit with the foods from Farmer's Delight."
		"Every food item that should quench your thirst added by farmer's delight, respite and brewin and chewin is integrated by default, making teas (or booze) the bestlate-game hydration source."
		""
		"The mod is compatible with apple skin, showing the \"quenched\" overlay if the mod is present, as well as tooltips for every item that quenches your thirst"
	]
	quest.289E7BA6F1DC1F33.quest_subtitle: "Water can have 4 different levels of purity, depending on where it was harvested"
	quest.289E7BA6F1DC1F33.title: "Purified Water Bottle"
	quest.28A3986C525017D4.quest_subtitle: "Animals listed here can randomly spawn anywhere among the seas on spawnable blocks of course"
	quest.28D02952490A2EEB.quest_desc: [
		"In Create: Stranded at Sea, there’s no hand-holding, or main questline to dictate your path. Your journey is yours to create, whether you want to explore the seas, automate within the create mod, or spend your time fishing to gather resources, it is up for you to decide."
		""
		"This modpack is built for self-discovery so to help in that, there many Quests aimed at breaking down all the features within the modpack to assist you in how things work."
	]
	quest.28D02952490A2EEB.quest_subtitle: "You awaken on a small raft amidst a vast, endless ocean, surrounded by nothing but waves and sea life. "
	quest.28D02952490A2EEB.title: "&o&l&bWelcome to Create: Stranded at Sea"
	quest.28E3FF4E1A684E45.quest_desc: ["Recipe: Bass or Perch + Any Cabbage + Any Mushroom"]
	quest.28E3FF4E1A684E45.quest_subtitle: "Gives Comfort. "
	quest.293196C72E44A5AC.quest_subtitle: "Lets you clear and pave whilst riding a train."
	quest.293CB0D8EC067D96.quest_desc: ["Can be found inside the Nether, which is usually partially submerged in lava. "]
	quest.2958CA7FA6FD3E4F.quest_desc: [
		"The icon in the top left of the screen is the &aFTB Teams &rmenu. This allows you to add other players to your team."
		""
		"On the right of the &aFTB Teams &ricon is the &6Quest Book &ricon, which allows you to access the &6Quest Book &rat any time."
		""
		"When you click the square at the top left of your player display, your &8Curios &rslots will become visible. Some items, such as Elytras and Totems can be equipped here."
		""
		""
	]
	quest.2958CA7FA6FD3E4F.quest_subtitle: "Read my description!"
	quest.2958CA7FA6FD3E4F.title: "&2Inventory"
	quest.29649C654117D56A.quest_subtitle: "A lever that can be set to output any redstone level."
	quest.29649C654117D56A.title: "Levered Up!"
	quest.29651727750CA09A.quest_subtitle: "So a Cog Crank is just essentially a Hand Crank, but instead of putting a crank on blocks or machinery, this crank is used for rotational force and direction of cogwheels."
	quest.29651727750CA09A.title: "Crank it all the way!"
	quest.29813C4BB0BC635E.quest_subtitle: "Villagers can be found locked away in jail cells located inside of the two listed ships"
	quest.29813C4BB0BC635E.title: "Rescue: Villager"
	quest.29BE60000310D7FB.quest_desc: ["Is your Minecraft build missing just the right piece of furniture? But none of your 749 installed furniture mods have what you need? Look no further! Immersive Furniture is the perfect solution for you. Create custom and fancy furniture, deco, and objects in-game or choose from a vast online library. Share your creations with the world and download furniture made by others."]
	quest.29BE60000310D7FB.quest_subtitle: "Create custom and fancy furniture, deco, and objects in-game or choose from a vast online library"
	quest.29EFF7AED691682B.quest_subtitle: "Lets you instantly break most Create blocks by shift + right-clicking. And rotate them by right-clicking."
	quest.29EFF7AED691682B.title: "This is not a Monkey Wrench"
	quest.29FB59B730725128.quest_desc: ["In the center of the arena is a monument with four blocks with an eye texture. Breaking one of these blocks will cause the monument to open, and the Nether Gauntlet will appear. It’s important to note that the Nether Gauntlet won’t take any damage unless it’s hit in the eye, which is on the front."]
	quest.2A0F7A2AA1C0E9C1.quest_subtitle: "A basic filter."
	quest.2A10E9F636A77AB7.quest_subtitle: "Iron and Diamond: chance to not use durability."
	quest.2A1A0E1881772371.quest_subtitle: "The Sticker is used to stick and unstick things to moving Contraptions."
