	quest.2AC8220A55B3C54B.quest_subtitle: "Works just like Sandpaper"
	quest.2AD0E81D4C391FD0.quest_subtitle: "Fly high even better"
	quest.2AFA69E8C6BCF178.quest_subtitle: "The shaft is a basic mechanical component in Create. A shaft can be used to connect two mechanical components such that the rotation of one rotates the other, and shafts serve as the only blocks upon which Mechanical Belts can be placed."
