	quest.3D7CE4017B17425B.quest_desc: ["Dump lava (preferrably via an automated method) on the active molten vent and watch as the lava turns into the corresponding orestone."]
	quest.3D7CE4017B17425B.quest_subtitle: "Notice that the dormant molten vent is now an active molten vent by seeing the magma in it become brighter"
	quest.3DA659956B952FCD.quest_subtitle: "The Threshold Switch measures how full an inventory is and can emit a Redstone signal at adjustable thresholds."
