	quest.4206216A5F414642.quest_subtitle: "With the power of dried kelp, mechanical belts are useful in moving items either in a straight line and diagonally. Make sure to stick one shaft on each end to connect so it will work."
	quest.4206216A5F414642.title: "Item Manipulation"
	quest.4230AD68B84A6FBE.quest_subtitle: "Perfect for building, and that's about it."
	quest.4234EABAC1AA2AE0.quest_subtitle: "The Depot is used as an interaction point for machines such as the Mechanical Arm."
	quest.426053EA0CD60DFD.quest_desc: ["Four Chiseled Stone Altars can be found on one of the floors. Each one requires a Soul Star to become activated. Once filled in, the Night Lich will spawn; if it isn’t already, the day will be turned to night."]
	quest.4267B97B18413E1D.quest_subtitle: "Since most blocks in Create don't allow for manual extraction and insertion of liquids these pipes are rather useful.\\n\\nCan also be used to create infinite water by extracting from a source-block that has 2 source-blocks adjacent to it."
	quest.42791E51884C3101.quest_desc: ["A tool to locate oil deposits. It works based on chunks, so it's recommended to press F3 and G simultaneously to enable chunk borders for easier navigation."]
	quest.42791E51884C3101.quest_subtitle: "By default, every chunk in the world may contain oil, the amount is determined through procedural generation, combined with biome influence."
	quest.42A4FAD05869BF4A.quest_subtitle: "Silicon can be crafted by smelting Certus Quartz Dust. It's used alongside an Inscriber and Inscriber Silicon Press to create Printed Silicon."
