	quest.44C3B2628015505C.title: "Mechanical Pistons"
	quest.44C7B7DD15CD7A49.quest_desc: [
		"Key Features:"
		"Spawned using the item"
		"Required by Bee Ports to send packages"
		"Carries packages directly to players or between Bee Ports"
	]
	quest.44C7B7DD15CD7A49.quest_subtitle: "The Robo Bee is an entity that delivers Create mod Packages to their destination. It follows the address on the package, delivering directly to players or between Bee Ports as needed."
	quest.44DA9519A195BC65.quest_desc: [
		"Overview:"
		"For a Mushroom Colony to grow, a Red or Brown Mushroom must be planted on Rich Soil, while under sufficient darkness for mushrooms to be plantable in any block (light level 12 or below). After a while, the single mushroom will transform into a colony."
		""
		"Colonies grow between 2 to 5 Mushrooms over time, but can't get boosted by the Rich Soil they're planted on. They can be broken with any tool to harvest all caps grown so far, or broken with Shears to obtain the entire colony as an item."
		""
		"Shears can also clip individual caps when used against a colony, always leaving two caps behind."
		""
		"Usage:"
		"Mushroom Colonies are mostly decorative outside their farming uses. They won't grow any bigger outside their requirements, allowing players to plant any stage they want by shearing the colony after relocating it."
		""
		"Brown Mushroom Colonies are a necessary ingredient for cooking Stuffed Pumpkin."
	]
	quest.44DA9519A195BC65.quest_subtitle: "Mushroom Colonies are clustered, fertilized growths of Mushrooms, which are easier to farm overall."
	quest.44E0DDEE0578557F.quest_subtitle: "A multi-block item storage that can't be accessed manually."
	quest.44F403DA4E4D56E3.quest_subtitle: "Process the orestones into resources, or use them for building."
	quest.44FC080A04EF3970.quest_subtitle: "Obtain a Tungsten Ingot from Wolframite Ore"
	quest.44FC080A04EF3970.title: "The Tungsten Age"
	quest.45026D6FEB75188F.quest_subtitle: "Made with Sugar and 4 Melon Slices, Melon Juice heals 1 heart (2 HP) instantly when consumed."
	quest.4525478B99097F3A.quest_subtitle: "Iron and Diamond: chance to not use durability."
	quest.45C290237C14B192.quest_subtitle: "Blocks all flower drops"
	quest.4613F6388966DB43.quest_subtitle: "Welcome to Create Enchantment Industry, a mod offering more tools and methods to handle experience and enchantment in Create."
	quest.4613F6388966DB43.title: "Enchantment Industry"
	quest.4643027ADBC0C97B.quest_desc: ["Can be used to fuel diesel generators."]
	quest.4693A83688C92D55.quest_desc: ["&bMinecraft Comes Alive (MCA)&r is a Minecraft mod that greatly &6extends the functionality of villagers&r by &aadding interaction, marriage, children genetics, and more!&r"]
	quest.4693A83688C92D55.title: "MCA Reborn"
	quest.469D2AC3C48360B3.quest_subtitle: "The Cart Assembler can attach a Contraption to Minecarts that pass through it when supplied with a Redstone signal."
	quest.471682642A192714.quest_subtitle: "A critically important material for most space related components"
	quest.473F1FE5E99F477F.quest_desc: ["Applying upgrade without changing the filter settings will not void any items. Add an item to the filter slot to have it voided when it enters the backpack via the Pickup Upgrade or a Hopper."]
	quest.473F1FE5E99F477F.quest_subtitle: "Provides a trash slot for manual item deletion and filters to automatically void items when they enter the backpack via the Pickup Upgrade or hoppers."
	quest.477C91235EB7A5EA.quest_subtitle: "Hope your wearing a space suit and have some oxygen"
	quest.477C91235EB7A5EA.title: "&eVist: &7Moon"
	quest.4795979571F1FAEA.quest_subtitle: "A modified furnace capable of generating AE Power instead of smelting ores. When placed on an ME Network it will charge Energy Cell or power other Network Devices.The Vibration Chamber will burn almost any solid burnable fuel for power. It will slow, or accelerate the burn depending on how much power it is able to store vs what is wasted. Generates between 1 and 10 AE/t depending on its burn speed."
	quest.4795979571F1FAEA.title: "Powering your Network 2"
	quest.47C04B47623D5002.quest_desc: [
		"Ever wanted to build a transportation network in Minecraft similar to ones in Satisfactory? Create: Hypertubes is an addon for the Create mod, inspired by Satisfactory Hypertubes, allowing you to construct intricate and seamless tube systems for moving players and entities with ease. Hypertubes offer a new way to travel in your Minecraft world."
		""
		"With an intuitive building system, you can design elegant and fun hypertubes with many curves to travel through, or build long, efficient straightaway tubes to power your logistics network! The options are limitless."
		""
		"Traveling:"
		"Jump into a Hypertube Entrance and and be thrown across your world"
		""
		"Placing Tubes:"
		"The components are designed to integrate smoothly into your existing Create progression, making it easy to get your Hypertube network up and running. Getting your network running is as simple as it gets: just power a Hypertube Entrance with a cogwheel and you're ready to go"
		""
		"Hypertube Entrance Modes:"
		"You can modify the Hypertube Entrance with a wrench to select your preferred mode!"
		"If you're using Automatic Lock Mode, you can sneak to avoid being pulled into the tube"
		""
		"Fish and Villagers:"
		"With version 0.2.0, fish and villagers can now travel through the tubes!"
		"Just turn on Automatic Lock Mode and watch them go :)"
		""
		"New visual customization:"
		"You can customize tube connections just by using a Wrench!"
		"(This is just the first step toward the customization milestone, any suggestions or help are welcome!)"
	]
	quest.47C04B47623D5002.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to construct seamless tube systems for moving players and entities with ease."
	quest.47C04B47623D5002.title: "Hypertubes"
	quest.47E42CDD36F87955.quest_subtitle: "Similar to tridents but with reduced damage output."
	quest.47EFAFDA1838AAD1.quest_desc: ["Extremely useful for potions, which can help the player create blends like strength potions, allowing for the automation of items such as gunpowder, redstone, and glowstone."]
	quest.48E5D56C47DF6642.quest_subtitle: "The thing your train goes on."
	quest.48E5D56C47DF6642.title: "Train Tracks"
	quest.4918B0939E4604A0.quest_subtitle: "Have a look at your entire inventory like a computer looking at all their files in one place and access them."
	quest.4918B0939E4604A0.title: "Terminals"
	quest.491EAE2957E15C5F.quest_desc: [
		"He draws his power from the sun, calling forth sunstrikes, solar flares, and massive solar beams. He can also create Umvuthana followers - including healers called Umvuthana Cranes - from masks to defend him during combat. As such, his masked children revere him as a god. Unequipped travelers should keep their distance from his grove, lest they be smitten by his heliomancy."
		""
		"Those strong enough to face and defeat him, however, are rewarded with his mask: the Sol Visage. This mask allows its wearers to breathe life into masks to create Umvuthana followers. Unfortunately, the mask does not bestow heliomancy upon its bearer; this power is innately carried by Umvuthi, and thus dies with him. Perhaps there is another way...?"
	]
	quest.491EAE2957E15C5F.quest_subtitle: "Umvuthi is the creator of the Abavuthana, residing in a stationary seat upon a throne in Mars vast plains"
	quest.493D7F76B7833B01.quest_desc: ["Recipe: Any Halibut + Egg + Onion + Any Cabbage"]
	quest.493D7F76B7833B01.quest_subtitle: "Gives Nourishment"
	quest.4962DD7F3E4D2AAD.title: "Lava"
	quest.496EFFCD484E1DD7.quest_subtitle: "Ponder Me"
	quest.496FC8106904193E.quest_subtitle: "Diesel Generators are a compact way of generating kinetic energy."
	quest.498B46B890735B82.quest_subtitle: "Use waystones to teleport around the world. Use the return scroll to return to the nearest waystone."
	quest.49901AE0CD7E39EF.title: "Craft Concrete Formwork"
	quest.49A353B20F687751.title: "Create a Diving Suit"
	quest.49EE6F88CD93352E.quest_subtitle: "When placed in front of the Encased Fan this allows it to blast items."
	quest.4A041E600B41F4C3.quest_subtitle: "Used alongside an Inscriber and Inscriber Calculation Plate to create a Printed Calculation Circuit."
	quest.4A141C0CF1C29A52.quest_subtitle: "Obtain a heart of the sea "
	quest.4A40A08DD2ED4A69.quest_desc: [
		"The hydration depletion speed is biome-dependent, meaning you will get thirsty more easily in hot or dry biomes, and less so in cold or wet ones. Hydration is more relevant than temperature, so building your base in wet biomes is more advisable than doing so in cold ones."
		"This system is also compatible with Cold Sweat, and will use their more precise temperature calculations if the mod is present in the pack."
		""
		"The stack size for water bottles has been increased to 64, to make them fit with the foods from Farmer's Delight."
		"Every food item that should quench your thirst added by farmer's delight, respite and brewin and chewin is integrated by default, making teas (or booze) the bestlate-game hydration source."
		""
		"The mod is compatible with apple skin, showing the \"quenched\" overlay if the mod is present, as well as tooltips for every item that quenches your thirst"
	]
	quest.4A40A08DD2ED4A69.quest_subtitle: "Water can have 4 different levels of purity, depending on where it was harvested"
