	quest.7D8766B9481E852B.quest_subtitle: "Controls the Rocket's Destination"
	quest.7D97C701B7895F08.quest_subtitle: "Diving Leggings complement Create's existing diving equipment, granting you super jump abilities beneath the water."
	quest.7DA320FD23E41B92.quest_subtitle: "Ponder the Mechanical Spawner to see how to use this block"
	quest.7DD05DDD6A816DFC.quest_subtitle: "Create: Bitterballen is an addon for Create which adds Dutch snacks. (Quests WIP)"
	quest.7DD05DDD6A816DFC.title: "Bitterballen"
	quest.7E33B2353751C098.quest_subtitle: "The Speedometer measures the speed of Rotational Force."
	quest.7E483C9BB6D1CFA2.quest_subtitle: "Can be created through the use of a mixer and various ingredients"
	quest.7E4A9EC31D487379.quest_desc: ["Aquaculture also adds a Tackle Box. In it, you can store all of these items and fish bait. The Tackle Box is also where you can attach equipment to the fishing rods."]
	quest.7E4A9EC31D487379.quest_subtitle: "Use the Tackle Box to attach equipment to the fishing rods like hooks and bait."
	quest.7E88F523959EB707.quest_subtitle: "The Powered Latch emits a redstone signal that can be toggled on or off by other signals."
	quest.7E8E6019017D76EC.quest_subtitle: "Sticks to blocks when powered by redstone."
	quest.7E8FC6A9FE02D50B.quest_subtitle: "The Mechanical Bearing is used to create and rotate Contraptions."
	quest.7EA4E2D90A0FBC21.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to walk underwater like you do on land as well as walk on belts without them moving you."
